In the evening, I arrive at the flat.
It is raining heavily outside.
I climb the stairs.
Just then, Anitha is coming down.
She looks at me and smiles.
"Maya, how was your day today?" Anitha asks.
"Everything went very well," I say.
I am very tired now.
But I am also very happy.
"Are the people in the new team nice?" she asks.
"Yes, everyone is very nice," I reply.
"I have spoken with everyone today."
"I have also understood my work well."
"That is a great thing," Anitha says happily.
"Have you eaten anything, Maya?" she asks.
"No, I have to make food now," I say.
"Okay, go and rest well," Anitha says.
I say goodnight and walk to the flat.
Now I feel that this new project is mine.
Tired but very happy, I open my door.
